{"code": "SS-Y3-T1-L17", "en": false, "slides": [{"bg": "1E3A3F", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 64, "y": 58, "w": 1152, "h": 58, "text": "الدِّراساتُ الاجْتِماعِيَّةُ وَالتَّرْبِيَةُ الأَخْلاقِيَّةُ · الصَّفُّ الثّالِثُ · الوَحْدَةُ الثّانِيَةُ: إِماراتي وَأَفْتَخِرُ", "size": 25, "color": "F2A93B", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 384, "y": 128, "w": 832, "h": 134, "text": "الْقِيادَةُ", "size": 78, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 384, "y": 269, "w": 832, "h": 64, "text": "الدَّرْسُ الثّالِثُ: الْباني الْمُؤَسِّسُ · ثانِيًا · كِتابي ص 81–82", "size": 28, "color": "CFE3E1", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 77, "y": 122, "w": 269, "h": 294, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L17/youngzayed.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "shape", "x": 64, "y": 442, "w": 1152, "h": 186, "fill": "27474D", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 90, "y": 454, "w": 1101, "h": 160, "text": "🎯 أَتَعَرَّفُ قِيادَةَ الشَّيْخِ زايِدٍ - رَحِمَهُ اللهُ -: تَعْيينَهُ مُمَثِّلًا لِلْحاكِمِ في الْعَيْنِ عامَ 1946م وَإِنْجازاتِهِ فيها، ثُمَّ انْتِقالَهُ إِلى حُكْمِ أَبوظَبي في 6 أَغُسْطُسَ 1966م وَإِصْلاحاتِهِ الْواسِعَةَ، وَأُقارِنُ بَيْنَ الْعَيْنِ قَديمًا وَحَديثًا.", "size": 32, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}], "n": "اقرأ العنوان بصوت واضح، واطلب من الطلاب فتح الكتاب على الصفحة."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🔁 نتذكّر معًا", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 3 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "النَّشْأَةُ وَالْهِواياتُ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 650, "y": 160, "w": 592, "h": 275, "rv": 1, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 665, "y": 168, "w": 561, "h": 51, "rv": 1, "text": "📅 1918م", "size": 27, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 665, "y": 221, "w": 561, "h": 204, "rv": 1, "text": "وُلِدَ في …", "size": 36, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 592, "h": 275, "rv": 2, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "6B46A8", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 168, "w": 561, "h": 51, "rv": 2, "text": "🦅 الصَّقْرُ", "size": 27, "color": "6B46A8", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 221, "w": 561, "h": 204, "rv": 2, "text": "يُعَلِّمُ …", "size": 36, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 461, "w": 1203, "h": 166, "rv": 3, "text": "الشّابُّ الَّذي تَعَلَّمَ الصَّبْرَ… كَيْفَ أَصْبَحَ قائِدًا؟", "size": 32, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[استرجاع التعلّم السابق] اسأل شفويًّا، واستمع لثلاث إجابات، ثم اكشف الجملة الأخيرة."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "✨ لحظة فضول", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 4 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "قائِدٌ يُكَرِّمُ طالِبَةً", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 883, "y": 160, "w": 358, "h": 333, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L17/student.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 819, "h": 96, "text": "🏅 الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ يُكَرِّمُ إِحْدى الطّالِباتِ الْمُتَفَوِّقاتِ…", "size": 32, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 262, "w": 819, "h": 122, "rv": 1, "text": "ماذا تُخْبِرُنا الصّورَةُ عَنِ اهْتِماماتِهِ كَقائِدٍ؟", "size": 32, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 397, "w": 819, "h": 96, "rv": 2, "text": "💬 أُفَكِّرُ وَحْدي ← أُخْبِرُ زَميلي ← نُشارِكُ الصَّفَّ.", "size": 28, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": "FFFDF8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 518, "w": 1203, "h": 122, "rv": 3, "text": "الْقِيادَةُ", "size": 36, "color": "B42318", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "FCE9DA", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[التهيئة وإثارة الدافعية] فكّر – زاوج – شارك. لا تكشف الإجابة قبل أن يخمّن الطلاب."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🎯 وجهتنا اليوم", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 2 دقيقة", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "وِجْهَتُنا الْيَوْمَ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 1203, "h": 128, "text": "🎯 أَتَعَرَّفُ قِيادَةَ الشَّيْخِ زايِدٍ - رَحِمَهُ اللهُ -: تَعْيينَهُ مُمَثِّلًا لِلْحاكِمِ في الْعَيْنِ عامَ 1946م وَإِنْجازاتِهِ فيها، ثُمَّ انْتِقالَهُ إِلى حُكْمِ أَبوظَبي في 6 أَغُسْطُسَ 1966م وَإِصْلاحاتِهِ الْواسِعَةَ، وَأُقارِنُ بَيْنَ الْعَيْنِ قَديمًا وَحَديثًا.", "size": 25, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": "FFFDF8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 853, "y": 307, "w": 388, "h": 333, "rv": 1, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "A35E24", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 869, "y": 315, "w": 358, "h": 51, "rv": 1, "text": "⭐ مُبْتَدِئٌ", "size": 27, "color": "A35E24", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 869, "y": 369, "w": 358, "h": 261, "rv": 1, "text": "أَذْكُرُ مَتى حَكَمَ الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ الْعَيْنَ وَأَبوظَبي.", "size": 32, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 446, "y": 307, "w": 388, "h": 333, "rv": 2, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "5F6C78", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 461, "y": 315, "w": 358, "h": 51, "rv": 2, "text": "⭐⭐ مُتَطَوِّرٌ", "size": 27, "color": "5F6C78", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 461, "y": 369, "w": 358, "h": 261, "rv": 2, "text": "أَذْكُرُ إِنْجازاتِهِ في الْعَيْنِ وَإِصْلاحاتِهِ في أَبوظَبي.", "size": 32, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 38, "y": 307, "w": 388, "h": 333, "rv": 3, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "6B46A8", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 315, "w": 358, "h": 51, "rv": 3, "text": "⭐⭐⭐ مُتَمَكِّنٌ", "size": 27, "color": "6B46A8", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 369, "w": 358, "h": 261, "rv": 3, "text": "أُقارِنُ بَيْنَ الْعَيْنِ قَديمًا وَحَديثًا وَأُفَسِّرُ أَثَرَ قِيادَتِهِ.", "size": 32, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}], "n": "[ناتج التعلّم ومعايير النجاح] اقرأ الهدف مع الطلاب، ووضّح ماذا يعني كل مستوى."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🔑 مفاتيح الدرس", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 6 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "كَلِماتٌ جَديدَةٌ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 955, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 352, "rv": 1, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "img", "x": 1038, "y": 173, "w": 122, "h": 122, "emo": "🏛️", "rv": 1}, {"k": "text", "x": 965, "y": 307, "w": 266, "h": 77, "rv": 1, "text": "مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ", "size": 27, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 965, "y": 390, "w": 266, "h": 109, "rv": 1, "text": "مَنْ يَنوبُ عَنِ الْحاكِمِ في إِدارَةِ مِنْطَقَةٍ", "size": 21, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 650, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 352, "rv": 2, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "img", "x": 732, "y": 173, "w": 122, "h": 122, "emo": "🌱", "rv": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 660, "y": 307, "w": 266, "h": 77, "rv": 2, "text": "التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ", "size": 27, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 660, "y": 390, "w": 266, "h": 109, "rv": 2, "text": "تَطْويرُ كُلِّ مَجالاتِ الْحَياةِ", "size": 27, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 344, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 352, "rv": 3, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "img", "x": 426, "y": 173, "w": 122, "h": 122, "emo": "🔧", "rv": 3}, {"k": "text", "x": 354, "y": 307, "w": 266, "h": 77, "rv": 3, "text": "الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 43, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 354, "y": 390, "w": 266, "h": 109, "rv": 3, "text": "أَعْمالٌ تُحَسِّنُ حَياةَ النّاسِ", "size": 27, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 531, "w": 1203, "h": 109, "rv": 5, "text": "🗣️ أَقولُ: «انْتَقَلَ الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ إِلى حُكْمِ أَبوظَبي عامَ …».", "size": 30, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": "FCE9DA", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[المفاهيم والمصطلحات] الكلمات الجديدة من الكتاب. اعرض الرمز، واطلب جملة شفوية بكل كلمة."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "📖 ركن القصة", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 7 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "رُكْنُ الْمَعْرِفَةِ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 294, "h": 384, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L17/youngzayed.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 352, "y": 160, "w": 890, "h": 224, "rv": 1, "text": "قَضى الشَّيْخُ زايِدُ بْنُ سُلْطانَ آلِ نَهْيانَ - رَحِمَهُ اللهُ - شَبابَهُ في الْعَيْنِ، وَعُيِّنَ مُمَثِّلًا لِلْحاكِمِ فيها عامَ 1946م مِمّا أَكْسَبَهُ خِبْرَةً في الْإِدارَةِ، وَاكْتَسَبَ حُبَّ وَاحْتِرامَ أَبْناءِ الْقَبائِلِ. اهْتَمَّ الْباني الْمُؤَسِّسُ الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ بِالتَّنْمِيَةِ في مَدينَةِ الْعَيْنِ وَحَقَّقَ إِنْجازاتٍ عَديدَةً، مِنْها الْمَشاريعُ التِّجارِيَّةُ وَالزِّراعِيَّةُ وَدَعْمُ التَّعْليمِ وَالصِّحَّةِ.", "size": 27, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": "FFFDF8", "rad": true, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 352, "y": 397, "w": 890, "h": 173, "rv": 2, "text": "في السّادِسِ مِنْ أَغُسْطُسَ 1966م، انْتَقَلَ الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ - رَحِمَهُ اللهُ - مِنْ حُكْمِ مَدينَةِ الْعَيْنِ إِلى أَبوظَبي، لِيَتَوَلّى قِيادَتَها. تَمَكَّنَ الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ - رَحِمَهُ اللهُ - مِنْ تَحْقيقِ إِصْلاحاتٍ واسِعَةٍ، مِنْها تَطْويرُ قِطاعاتِ التَّعْليمِ وَالرِّعايَةِ الصِّحِّيَّةِ، وَالْإِسْكانُ الشَّعْبِيُّ وَتَحْديثُها، وَتَطْويرُ الْمُدُنِ بِوَجْهٍ عامٍّ.", "size": 25, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "top"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 582, "w": 1203, "h": 64, "rv": 3, "text": "🔎 مَتى عُيِّنَ مُمَثِّلًا لِلْحاكِمِ في الْعَيْنِ؟ وَمَتى انْتَقَلَ إِلى حُكْمِ أَبوظَبي؟ وَما إِصْلاحاتُهُ؟", "size": 27, "color": "6B46A8", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[استكشاف المصادر (نص الكتاب وصوره)] اقرأ النص قراءة معبّرة والطلاب يتابعون في الكتاب، ثم اسأل: من؟ كم عمره؟"}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "👩‍🏫 شاهدني أطبّق", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 5 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "مَراحِلُ الْقِيادَةِ", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 955, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 134, "rv": 1, "fill": "A35E24", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 955, "y": 163, "w": 286, "h": 64, "rv": 1, "text": "1946م", "size": 36, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 955, "y": 227, "w": 286, "h": 58, "rv": 1, "text": "مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ في الْعَيْنِ", "size": 25, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 650, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 134, "rv": 1, "fill": "16A34A", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 650, "y": 163, "w": 286, "h": 64, "rv": 1, "text": "الْعَيْنُ", "size": 36, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 650, "y": 227, "w": 286, "h": 58, "rv": 1, "text": "تِجارَةٌ · زِراعَةٌ · تَعْليمٌ · صِحَّةٌ", "size": 25, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 344, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 134, "rv": 1, "fill": "2563EB", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 344, "y": 163, "w": 286, "h": 64, "rv": 1, "text": "6/8/1966", "size": 36, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 344, "y": 227, "w": 286, "h": 58, "rv": 1, "text": "حاكِمُ أَبوظَبي", "size": 25, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 286, "h": 134, "rv": 1, "fill": "DC2626", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 163, "w": 286, "h": 64, "rv": 1, "text": "أَبوظَبي", "size": 36, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 227, "w": 286, "h": 58, "rv": 1, "text": "تَعْليمٌ · صِحَّةٌ · إِسْكانٌ · مُدُنٌ", "size": 25, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 38, "y": 314, "w": 1203, "h": 179, "rv": 2, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 321, "w": 1172, "h": 51, "rv": 2, "text": "👩‍🏫 أُقارِنُ: الْعَيْنُ قَديمًا وَحَديثًا", "size": 27, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 375, "w": 1172, "h": 108, "rv": 2, "text": "قَديمًا: بُيوتٌ بَسيطَةٌ وَأَفْلاجٌ وَمَزارِعُ صَغيرَةٌ ← خِبْرَةُ زايِدٍ في الْإِدارَةِ وَالتَّنْمِيَةِ\n← حَديثًا: مَدينَةٌ خَضْراءُ فيها جامِعاتٌ وَمُسْتَشْفَياتٌ وَأَسْواقٌ… قِيادَةٌ تَصْنَعُ الْفَرْقَ.", "size": 27, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}, {"k": "shape", "x": 38, "y": 508, "w": 1203, "h": 134, "rv": 3, "fill": "FFFDF8", "line": "B42318", "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 2}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 516, "w": 1172, "h": 51, "rv": 3, "text": "💡 زايِدٌ يُحِبُّ وَطَنَهُ", "size": 27, "color": "B42318", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 54, "y": 570, "w": 1172, "h": 63, "rv": 3, "text": "«إِنَّ الِاتِّحادَ يَعيشُ في نَفْسي وَفي قَلْبي، وَأَعَزُّ ما في وُجودي.»", "size": 30, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}], "n": "[النمذجة: «أنا أطبّق»] عرّف بنفسك أمام الطلاب بالقالب نفسه، ثم اطلب من متطوّع."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🤝 نطبّق معًا", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 7 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "صَحيحٌ أَمْ خَطَأٌ؟", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 650, "y": 160, "w": 592, "h": 314, "rv": 1, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L16/map.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "pic", "x": 38, "y": 160, "w": 592, "h": 314, "rv": 2, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L16/oldad.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 489, "w": 1203, "h": 77, "rv": 3, "text": "👆 «تَقَعُ مَدينَةُ الْعَيْنِ إِلى الْغَرْبِ مِنْ أَبوظَبي»… نَنْظُرُ إِلى الْخَريطَةِ: هَلْ هٰذا صَحيحٌ؟", "size": 27, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "FFFDF8", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 576, "w": 1203, "h": 70, "rv": 4, "text": "📘 كِتابي ص 82: أُلَوِّنُ الْمُرَبَّعَ أَمامَ الْعِبارَةِ الصَّحيحَةِ، وَأُلْصِقُ صُوَرًا لِمَدينَةِ الْعَيْنِ قَديمًا وَحَديثًا.", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}], "n": "[الممارسة الموجّهة: «نطبّق معًا»] اعرض الصورتين، وعُدّوا معًا. ثم نفّذوا نشاط الكتاب."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🚦 إشارة الانطلاق", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 2 دقيقة", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "انْتَقَلَ الشَّيْخُ زايِدٌ إِلى حُكْمِ أَبوظَبي في:", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 662, "w": 1203, "h": 46, "text": "🎯 مُمَثِّلُ الْحاكِمِ · التَّنْمِيَةُ الشّامِلَةُ · الْإِصْلاحاتُ", "size": 21, "color": "0F6E72", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "E2F0EF", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 701, "y": 160, "w": 490, "h": 294, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L17/youngzayed.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 650, "y": 454, "w": 592, "h": 58, "text": "(أ)", "size": 36, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 90, "y": 160, "w": 490, "h": 294, "src": "resources/ss/g3/SS-Y3-T1-L17/student.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "text", "x": 38,